R7.84 introduces:

SEMANTIC_DOMAIN_INTERSECTION

For:

D₁
D₂

the federation computes:

D₁ ∩ D₂

If:

D₁ ∩ D₂ = ∅

there may be no shared constitutional semantic space.

If:

D₁ ∩ D₂ ≠ ∅

the overlap itself requires analysis.

The existence of overlap does not establish compatibility.


