IV. 🧩 THREE POSSIBLE RELATIONSHIPS

1. COMPLEMENTARY

M₁ + M₂

Each meaning supplies a different dimension without contradiction.

2. CONDITIONALLY_COMPATIBLE

M₁ + M₂

is valid only when condition C holds.

3. CONTRADICTORY

M₁ ⟂ M₂

Their combination cannot satisfy the same constitutional determination.

Therefore HORTUS must never collapse:

DIFFERENT

into:

CONTRADICTORY

nor:

COMPATIBLE

into:

COMPOSABLE


