Want dan is het probleem niet langer:

WHICH ANCHOR IS VALID?

maar:

CAN MULTIPLE VALID CONSTITUTIONAL REFERENCE FRAMES COEXIST WITHOUT CREATING MULTIPLE INCOMPATIBLE TRUTHS?

