   ↓
OVERLAP ANALYSIS
   ↓
COMPATIBILITY
   ↓
RECONCILIATION / PARTITION
   ↓
TRIAS
   ↓
COMPOSITION REFERENCE

Zonder deze gate:

NO FEDERATED REFERENCE INHERITANCE


