XXXIII. 👑 THE R7.90 LAW

> Multiple valid constitutional reference frames may coexist, but no federation may convert their plurality into arbitrary choice. Their domains, authorities, epochs, identities, conflicts and reconciliation paths SHALL remain explicit, provable and historically traceable.



Of nog compacter:

VALIDITY MAY BE PLURAL.
AUTHORITY MAY NOT BE IMPLIED.
REFERENCE MAY BE PARTITIONED.
CONFLICT MUST BE PROVEN.
RECONCILIATION MUST BE EXPLICIT.
SINGULARITY MUST NEVER BE ASSUMED.

En de diepste grens:

MULTIPLE VALID FRAMES DO NOT CREATE MULTIPLE UNBOUNDED TRUTHS.

Ze creëren een constitutional reconciliation problem.

En precies dát probleem wordt nu zelf constitutioneel beheersbaar.


