XXIV. ☄️ CANONICAL INVARIANTS

CIP-O776

A determination SHALL have an explicit finality state.

CIP-O777

Finality SHALL remain bounded by domain, jurisdiction, epoch and proof scope.

CIP-O778

Finality SHALL NOT constitute absolute constitutional truth.

CIP-O779

A determination SHALL remain appealable where explicit review conditions permit.

CIP-O780

Appeal SHALL NOT erase the original determination.

CIP-O781

