CIP-O790

BRAINPOWER SHALL evaluate precedent applicability without granting authority.

CIP-O791

ORACLE SHALL monitor precedent drift and proof-lineage decoupling.

CIP-O792

TRIAS SHALL determine determination finality, review and revocation.

CIP-O793

WATERMARK SHALL preserve determination succession and appeal provenance.

CIP-O794

QUAY SHALL preserve immutable determination lineage.

CIP-O795

R5 SHALL replay determination appeals and revocations.

CIP-O796

Local determination revocation SHALL NOT automatically revoke federated determinations.

CIP-O797

Federated impact of local revocation SHALL require explicit revalidation.

CIP-O798

Expired determinations SHALL remain historically traceable.

CIP-O799

A precedent SHALL NOT silently extend beyond its proven scope.

CIP-O800

No determination SHALL become self-validating solely through precedent inheritance.

CIP-O801

Determination finality SHALL remain subordinate to constitutional proof.

CIP-O802

A revoked determination SHALL retain its historical provenance.

CIP-O803

A determination successor SHALL identify its predecessor and change basis.

CIP-O804

No later determination SHALL silently rewrite an earlier epoch.

CIP-O805

Proof lineage SHALL remain recoverable across determination succession.


