DIRECT_PROOF_DEPENDENCY
INDIRECT_PROOF_DEPENDENCY
CONTEXTUAL_REFERENCE
PRECEDENT_REFERENCE
IDENTITY_DEPENDENCY
DOMAIN_DEPENDENCY
AUTHORITY_DEPENDENCY
TEMPORAL_DEPENDENCY

De belangrijkste grens:

REFERENCE
≠
CONSTITUTIONAL DEPENDENCY


