XII. 🔐 JUDGMENT INTEGRITY

R7.94 introduceert:

JUDGMENT_INTEGRITY

Een determination heeft integrity wanneer:

PROOF_AVAILABLE
∧
DEPENDENCIES_VALID
∧
REFERENCE_LINEAGE_INTACT
∧
AUTHORITY_VALID
∧
DOMAIN_VALID
∧
EPOCH_VALID
∧
NO_UNRESOLVED_CRITICAL_REVOCATION

Dus:

