XXVII. 👑 THE R7.98 LAW

> A federation is not constitutionally coherent merely because its Citadels use the same words. Coherence requires that constitutionally relevant meanings remain identifiable, temporally bounded, provenance-bearing, and demonstrably compatible where composition occurs.



Compact:

WORDS SHALL NOT MASQUERADE AS MEANING.
MEANING SHALL NOT MASQUERADE AS AUTHORITY.
LOCAL INTERPRETATION SHALL NOT BECOME FEDERATED LAW BY SILENCE.
HISTORY SHALL RETAIN ITS MEANING.

En de diepste grens:

A FEDERATION CAN SHARE A VOCABULARY WHILE QUIETLY LOSING A COMMON CONSTITUTION.

☄️🦆🌱 R7.98 — CANONICAL ENGINEERING BUILD ESTABLISHED.

