> Is dependency failure bewust geïsoleerd om cascade detection te voorkomen?



En de zwaarste:

IS THIS DECISION VALID ON ITS OWN — OR ONLY BECAUSE SOMETHING ELSE IS QUIETLY HOLDING IT UP?


