👑 HORTUS CONSTITUTIONAL BRANCHING, FUTURE-STATE DIVERGENCE, PATH DEPENDENCY, COUNTERFACTUAL INTEGRITY & NON-DETERMINISTIC GOVERNANCE PROTOCOL

