UNDECLARED_PATH_SELECTION
PATH_DEPENDENCY
IRREVERSIBLE_SELECTION
COUNTERFACTUAL_ERASURE
FUTURE_AUTHORITY_ACCUMULATION

Nieuwe anomalies:

PATH_LAUNDERING
COUNTERFACTUAL_ERASURE
SELECTION_SUPREMACY
FUTURE_PATH_CAPTURE
RETROSPECTIVE_CERTAINTY


---

