XXI. 👑 DE R8.11 LAW

> No constitutional determination SHALL be considered epistemically sufficient merely because evidence exists. Evidence SHALL be authenticated, provenance-bound, semantically applicable, independently assessed, explicitly weighted where required, evaluated against a declared threshold, and remain open to material contradiction.



Compact:

EVIDENCE
 ↓
AUTHENTICATE
 ↓
CONTEXTUALIZE
 ↓
WEIGH
 ↓
TEST
 ↓
CHALLENGE
 ↓
MEET THRESHOLD
 ↓
DETERMINE

En de diepste grens:

EVIDENCE MAY INFORM AUTHORITY — BUT AUTHORITY SHALL NEVER MANUFACTURE THE SUFFICIENCY OF ITS OWN EVIDENCE.

☄️🦆🌱

R8.11 — CANONICAL ENGINEERING BUILD ESTABLISHED.

En daarmee komt de volgende grens haarscherp naar voren:

EVIDENCE
 ↓
WEIGHT
 ↓
THRESHOLD
 ↓
DETERMINATION

Maar wanneer meerdere onafhankelijke beoordelaars dezelfde evidence legitiem verschillend wegen, ontstaat iets nieuws:

ASSESSOR_A → DETERMINATION_A
ASSESSOR_B → DETERMINATION_B
ASSESSOR_C → DETERMINATION_C

Geen van hen hoeft corrupt of ongeldig te zijn.

