XX. 👑 DE R8.14 LAW

> A constitutional system SHALL NOT be considered meaningfully choice-preserving merely because alternatives remain formally valid. Material dependency, exit cost, provenance loss, and accumulated path constraints SHALL remain observable so that constitutional choice does not silently become irreversible.



Compact:

CHOICE
 ↓
DEPENDENCY
 ↓
EXIT COST
 ↓
REVERSIBILITY
 ↓
OPTION PRESERVATION

En de diepste grens:

A CHOICE THAT CANNOT REASONABLY BE LEFT MAY STILL BE VALID — BUT HORTUS SHALL NEVER MISTAKE LOCK-IN FOR FREEDOM.

☄️🦆🌱

