XXI. 👑 DE R8.15 LAW

> Every material constitutional consequence SHALL remain traceable to the decisions, dependencies, authorities, and conditions that materially contributed to its emergence. No actor, decision, or successor SHALL acquire retrospective responsibility merely from temporal proximity or outcome association.



