XII. 🏛️ TRIAS — WARNING DETERMINATION

TRIAS ontvangt:

PRECURSOR_GRAPH
SIGNAL_SET
TEMPORAL_ORDER
RISK_CONTEXT
RESPONSE_OPTIONS
ACTOR_AUTHORITY
EVIDENCE
FOOL_CHALLENGES
ORACLE_SIGNALS

en bepaalt:

NO_MATERIAL_WARNING
WARNING_PRESENT
