XXII. 👑 DE R8.18 LAW

> A constitutional feedback loop SHALL remain distinguishable from constitutional legitimacy. Recursive system behavior may be valid, but no determination, authority, reference, or proof SHALL acquire legitimacy solely through recursive self-reference or repeated internal reinforcement. Material circular justification SHALL require independent constitutional anchoring.



Compact:

OUTPUT
 ↓
INPUT
 ↓
FEEDBACK
 ↓
