☄️🌱 R8.20 — EMERGENT CONSTITUTIONAL STRUCTURE

De cruciale nieuwe scheiding wordt:

BEHAVIOR
   ↓
REPETITION
   ↓
PATTERN
   ↓
EMERGENCE
   ↓
STRUCTURAL PERSISTENCE
   ↓
