III. 🧬 CONSEQUENCE DOES NOT REWRITE ORIGIN

Nieuwe fundamentele regel:

> A consequence SHALL NOT rewrite the constitutional status of the decision that caused it.



Wanneer:

D₁ → C₁ → C₂ → C₃

kan C₃ niet zelfstandig bewijzen dat D₁ legitiem was.

De causal chain blijft:

ORIGIN
 ↓
DECISION
 ↓
EXECUTION
 ↓
CONSEQUENCE

Niet:

CONSEQUENCE
 ↓
RETROACTIVE AUTHORIZATION
 ↓
