XV. 🧬 PARTIAL RECOGNITION

R8.29 introduceert:

PARTIAL_RECOGNITION

Bijvoorbeeld:

IDENTITY = RECOGNIZED
OPERATION = RECOGNIZED
AUTHORITY = UNPROVEN
JURISDICTION = LIMITED
LEGITIMACY = UNDETERMINED

Dat is veel preciezer dan:

SYSTEM = RECOGNIZED


