RECOGNITION
 ↓
REVALIDATION
 ↓
CONFIRM

of:

RECOGNITION
 ↓
NEW EVIDENCE
 ↓
REVIEW
 ↓
REVOKE / LIMIT

Nieuwe kernregel:

> Recognition SHALL remain revocable where its constitutional basis, evidence, scope, or authority basis materially changes.




