PROOF_CLOSURE_STATE

met:

OPEN
 ↓
UNDER_REVIEW
 ↓
ANCHORED
 ↓
ADMISSIBILITY_CHECK
 ↓
CLOSED

Maar:

CLOSED
 ↓
NEW MATERIAL EVIDENCE
 ↓
REOPEN

Dus closure is:

REVERSIBLE_WHEN_TRIGGERED

en nooit:

PERMANENT_BY_DECLARATION


