XXI. 👑 R8.31 LAW

> A constitutional proof system SHALL terminate regression through explicitly admissible, scope-appropriate, non-self-validating anchors rather than through an unlimited hierarchy of validators. Proof closure SHALL remain distinguishable from absolute truth and SHALL remain reopenable upon material change. No anchor, validator, authority, federation, consensus mechanism, or 5+2 Ambassador configuration SHALL acquire unlimited constitutional authority merely by recursively validating itself or being repeatedly recognized by dependent actors.



Compact:

CLAIM
 ↓
PROOF
 ↓
ANCHOR
 ↓
ADMISSIBILITY
 ↓
INDEPENDENCE
 ↓
CLOSURE
 ↓
REVALIDABILITY


