XIX. 🜂🔥 R8.50 LAW

> A persistent emergent structure MAY become constitutionally relevant through its systemic effects, even when no actor explicitly designed it. Such relevance SHALL be detected rather than presumed, evidenced rather than inferred, and validated rather than self-declared. Emergent structure, de facto effect, authority and legitimacy SHALL remain constitutionally distinguishable.



