XVII. 🜂🔥 R8.51 LAW

> Constitutional systems SHALL distinguish the existence, classification, recognition, legitimation and authorization of emergent structures. Recognition of an emergent structure SHALL NOT itself confer constitutional authority, and any material behavioral effect caused by recognition SHALL remain observable, attributable and subject to independent constitutional review.



