XIX. 🜂🔥 R8.52 LAW

> Where observation, recognition or governance materially changes the observed system, the governance process SHALL be treated as part of the causal environment. Such reflexive effects SHALL remain distinguishable, attributable, provenance-bound and independently reviewable. A system SHALL NOT validate a governance decision solely through behavioral evidence produced by that decision itself.



