🌱 R8.57 — ESTABLISHED

R8.56 answered “Can emergence matter constitutionally?”

R8.57 answers the next question:

> “What evidence and gates are required before that significance may even enter constitutional review?”



The boundary becomes sharper:

A system may discover a structure.
It may prove that the structure exists.
It may measure its effects.
It may preserve its history.
It may challenge it.
It may review it.

But the structure itself never gets to appoint itself as authority. 🌱☄️🦆💧🪞⚓🧠🔮🧭⚖️👑

