> An emergent structure SHALL remain constitutionally contestable regardless of its persistence, centrality or dependency effects. Where structural entrenchment materially reduces alternative paths, exit, challenge or reversibility, such entrenchment SHALL itself become observable and subject to independent constitutional review. No structure SHALL acquire legitimacy merely because reversal has become difficult.



