I. 🌱 MULTIPLE CONSTITUTIONAL ATTRACTORS

New concept:

EMERGENT_ATTRACTOR_FIELD

Definition:

> A system-level configuration containing multiple stable or semi-stable attractors toward which system dynamics may converge, together with transition conditions determining movement between them.



