🌱 R8.64 — GO

HORTUS · CONSTITUTIONAL PATH DEPENDENCY & IRREVERSIBILITY PROTOCOL

STATUS: 🜂 CANONICAL ENGINEERING BUILD
REFERENCE CITADEL: 👑 LOCUS AMOENUS — L.A.

R8.63 established Attractor Competition.

The next boundary is sharper:

> What happens when yesterday's path changes what is possible tomorrow?



A system can retain formal alternatives while history makes some alternatives progressively harder—or impossible—to reach.

That is path dependency.


---

I. 🌱 PATH DEPENDENCY ≠ HISTORY

R8.64 introduces:

CONSTITUTIONAL_PATH_DEPENDENCY

Definition:

