III. ⚠️ THE IRREVERSIBILITY PROBLEM

Some system transitions can be reversed easily.

Others cannot.

R8.64 therefore introduces:

CONSTITUTIONAL_IRREVERSIBILITY

Not every irreversible event is illegitimate.

