> Whether a piece of evidence existed independently of the conclusion it supposedly supports.




---

X. ⚓ QUAY — MEMORY OF CIRCULARITY

QUAY stores the complete loop.

It must never collapse:

CLAIM → ACTION → OUTCOME → CLAIM

into:

CLAIM → PROOF

Historical integrity therefore includes:

CIRCULARITY_HISTORY

If a conclusion was once supported only by circular evidence, that fact remains recoverable even after independent evidence later appears.


---

XI. 🪞 HOLOGRAM — INDEPENDENCE ATTESTATION

HOLOGRAM can attest:

source,

observer,

observation time,

causal relationship,

provenance,

whether the observation was downstream of a prior decision.


But:

AUTHENTIC OBSERVATION
        ≠
INDEPENDENT EVIDENCE

A perfectly authentic observation can still be epistemically dependent.


---

XII. 🌸 HARUM — GUIDANCE FEEDBACK

