 ↓
HARUM LEARNS A WORKS
 ↓
HARUM RECOMMENDS A MORE OFTEN
 ↓
A BECOMES DEFAULT

The apparent evidence:

> “Users consistently choose A.”



may actually be partly produced by:

> “HARUM consistently recommends A.”



Therefore:

GUIDANCE_FEEDBACK_CONTAMINATION

must be detectable.

HARUM SHALL distinguish:

USER-INDEPENDENT PREFERENCE

from:

SYSTEM-INFLUENCED BEHAVIOR


