I. ☄️ CORRELATION ≠ CAUSATION ≠ LEGITIMATION

R8.69 establishes a three-way separation:

CORRELATION
   ≠
CAUSATION
   ≠
CONSTITUTIONAL LEGITIMATION

A repeated association does not establish causality.

A causal relationship does not automatically establish legitimacy.

And legitimacy cannot be inferred merely because an action appears to produce desirable consequences.


---

II. 🧬 CAUSAL EMERGENCE CHAIN

R8.69 introduces:

