Core question:

> Could the actor actually exercise the possibility that the constitution says exists?




---

VI. 🔮 ORACLE — AGENCY OBSERVATORY

ORACLE receives:

REALIZED_AGENCY_OBSERVATORY

Signals:

AGENCY_GAP
CAPABILITY_DECAY
ACCESS_BARRIER
