XIV. ⚓ QUAY — MEMORY OF CAPABILITY

QUAY preserves:

CAPABILITY₁
 ↓
CAPABILITY₂
 ↓
CAPABILITY₃
 ↓
CAPABILITY LOSS
 ↓
RESTORATION?

No retroactive simplification:

> “They could always have chosen.”



unless the historical record supports it.

This extends R8.70's road-not-taken memory into capacity-to-travel memory.


---

XV. 🪞 HOLOGRAM — AGENCY ATTESTATION

HOLOGRAM may attest:

that an option was presented,

that access existed,

that an actor attempted an action,

that a constraint was observed,

that a state transition occurred.


But:

OBSERVED ATTEMPT
≠
PROOF OF FREE CHOICE

Attestation preserves evidence.

It does not manufacture autonomy.


---

