MEMBER B → agreement Y

The existence of competing recollections or commitments does not itself establish which is authoritative.

Therefore:

> Household disagreement SHALL remain distinguishable from household authority.



The system must preserve:

WHAT WAS AGREED?
WHAT WAS OBSERVED?
WHAT IS DISPUTED?
WHAT REMAINS UNKNOWN?


---

XV. 🪶 FEATHER — ECOLOGICAL CONFLICT

FEATHER receives:

ECOLOGICAL_ANCHOR_CONFLICT

