safety,

continuity,

evidence,

system integrity,

human agency.


Therefore HORTUS introduces:

CONTAINMENT_ACTION

Such action must remain:

BOUNDED
TEMPORARY
TRACEABLE
NON-PRECEDENTIAL
REVIEWABLE

Most importantly:

> Emergency containment SHALL preserve the constitutional boundary; it SHALL NOT silently become replacement authority.




