       ↓            ↓              ↓
       └────────────┴──────────────┘
                    ↓
             AUTHORITY ACTIVE
                    ↓
             TEMPORARY MECHANISM
                 TERMINATES

The final step is mandatory.

A vacuum-exit mechanism must itself have an exit.


