DEPENDENCY_ACCUMULATION

EXCEPTION_NORMALIZATION

AUTHORITY_PERSISTENCE

REVERSAL_FEASIBILITY

Core question:

> Can we still safely return to the constitutional state that existed before the intervention?




---

