But Oracle does not authorize continuation.


---

VII. 🧭 MENTOR — MAKE REVERSIBILITY VISIBLE

MENTOR receives:

REVERSIBILITY_EXPLANATION

It explains:

WHAT CHANGED?
WHY?
WHAT WAS THE PREVIOUS STATE?
CAN IT BE RESTORED?
WHAT DEPENDS ON THE NEW STATE?
WHAT WOULD REVERSAL AFFECT?
WHEN DOES THE ACTION EXPIRE?
