PLURAL_EXIT_INTEGRITY

Because plurality requires more than multiple opinions.

It requires:

MULTIPLE VIABLE PATHS

Therefore:

> A constitutional system SHALL preserve meaningful alternative paths where their elimination would materially concentrate authority or reduce legitimate plurality.



This extends R8.43 → R8.56 → R9.09.


